            "review_text": "B. LE\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam273 contributions\n1\nGood buffet, price is ok, decoration is ok but lobsters took 3 years to be served at our table\nAug 2018 • Couples\nGood buffet, price is ok, decoration is ok but lobsters took 3 years to be served at our table, the restaurant is nice, the staff at the oysters counter were rude consistently, we went there three times, 3 times we had to talk with the manager, they talked to us with a condescending tone, they did not open the oyster we have chosen but replace them with others... it was really a disappointing experience only for that.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 29, 2018",
