            "review_text": "DuyenLai\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam42 contributions\n0\nDinner Buffet on Thursday\nJun 2018 • Couples\ncame and enjoy dinner at Charm Cham restaurant. The food was good and the service excellent, seafood fresh and have a lot options for us.\nbut when I came to take some oysters, and then I wanna cooked it, a chefs look didn’t like when I requested that, and then he lead me go around until the manager came and fix it. \nthe buffet closed at 21:30pm but no one came to confirmed with us.\nRead more\nWritten June 7, 2018",
