            "review_text": "Bert D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam36 contributions\n0\nNice Hardware pure Software\nJan 2018 • Friends\nSad to say that was the only thing i really can recommend. \n\nFood was not especially good, of course a lot of dishes available, less but good perhaps would be better. \n\nQuality is poor and no one really takes care of buffet, even not many customer, but sushi out, sashimi fish was not really fresh, Salami was sweating, Beef steak mountain looked un appetizing and beef, fried in a cold frying pan, beef was tough and of poor quality. Overall food Quality is definitely below standard and not reflects the beauty of the restaurant. The restaurant would perhaps do a lot better under Foreign Management than local as many Mistakes could be noticed from floor staff as well as Kitchen staff serving buffet. \n\nThe worst was that they called last call at 9.35 pm, and our table went out to Circe K to buy beer, Staff where eager to close down at 10pm and our table was a table of 16.\n\nOverall rather disappointing on quality. The Hardware out performs the software.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 8, 2018",
