            "review_text": "DENIS C\nFontenay-sous-Bois, France1491 contributions\n0\nFantastic !\nJul 2017 • Family\nSuperb classy restaurant but you can go in shorts as well! Very beautiful building superb atmosphere , tables are well separated from one to the other\nBuffet is superb! Lobster, slipper lobster, crab super fresh oysters , sushi, anything they have great selection of meats , great dessert. Cheeses , free flow of decent chilien wine. Maybe a little bit pricy for Vietnam but you will not find this kind of buffet and service anywhere else in the world for what you will pay there Good service\nOne of the restaurant owned by the Khaï silk founder\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2017",
